-- The source is its runs of lines in order (no-filesystem-lines-1, …); a piece that selects lines is those
-- runs, so an edit to a line is an edit of the piece holding it and no piece can move off its lines
-- (2026-11-17: pieces had selected byte ranges, which every earlier edit shifted)
no-filesystem-lines-1 : List (List Word)
no-filesystem-lines-1 = cons "# No file paths in the code" (cons "" nil)
